  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>MAT322 - Romberg Integration</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>In Romberg integration, suppose we have the following Trapezoidal Rule approximations:</p>
<ul>
<li>\(R_{1,1} = {@R11@}\) (using step size \(h\))</li>
<li>\(R_{2,1} = {@R21@}\) (using step size \(h/2\))</li>
</ul>
<p>Calculate the extrapolated value \(R_{2,2}\) using Richardson Extrapolation.</p>
<p>Answer: [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<h3>Worked Solution</h3>
<p>The formula for Richardson Extrapolation in Romberg integration is:</p>
<p>\[ R_{k,j} = R_{k,j-1} + \frac{R_{k,j-1} - R_{k-1,j-1}}{4^{j-1} - 1} \]</p>
<p>For \(R_{2,2}\) (where \(k=2, j=2\)):</p>
<p>\[ R_{2,2} = R_{2,1} + \frac{R_{2,1} - R_{1,1}}{4^1 - 1} = R_{2,1} + \frac{R_{2,1} - R_{1,1}}{3} \]</p>
<p>\[ R_{2,2} = {@R21@} + \frac{{@R21@} - {@R11@}}{3} = {@ta1@} \]</p>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
    <defaultgrade>1</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.1</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <idnumber></idnumber>
    <stackversion>
      <text>2025073100</text>
    </stackversion>
    <questionvariables>
      <text>R11: float(rand(100)/10 + 1);
diff: float(rand(10)/100 + 0.01);
R21: R11 + diff; /* R21 usually closer to true value */
ta1: R21 + (R21 - R11)/3;
</text>
    </questionvariables>
    <specificfeedback format="html">
      <text></text>
    </specificfeedback>
    <questionnote format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>R11={@R11@}, R21={@R21@}. R22={@ta1@}.</p>]]></text>
